OL,3,GNEWSADan Thomas resigns as Reform Wales
OL,4,Aleader after arrest on suspicion of
OL,5,Aassault
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK's Dan Thomas has quit as the
OL,8,Fparty's Welsh leader, after he was
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of assault and
OL,10,Fcontrolling or coercive behaviour on
OL,11,FSunday.
OL,13,FGwent Police said a 45-year-old man
OL,14,Ffrom Aberbargoed, in Caerphilly was
OL,15,Fbailed pending further enquiries.
OL,17,FIn a statement issued by his party,
OL,18,FThomas said he was "standing down" from
OL,19,Fhis position due to personal reasons.
OL,20,FHe said he had been "released without
OL,21,Fcharge" and had "done nothing wrong".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
